spec Escrow

// Token conservation across initialize/exchange/cancel is enforced
// operationally by the `transfers` blocks and exercised by the cover
// paths below. A description-only `invariant` has no predicate body to
// lower (SPL balances live in token accounts, not `State`), and would
// fail check with invariant_no_body (Severity::Error).

cover happy_path [initialize, exchange]

cover cancel_path [initialize, cancel]

liveness escrow_settles : State.Open ~> State.Closed via [exchange, cancel] within 1
